=== Prompt for EPAM-CR-001 (attempt 1) ===
Implement user story EPAM-CR-001: Contextual Purveyor Review

## Story Description
Run the Contextual Purveyor Agent (CPA) pre-pass over all upcoming stories. Retrieves relevant KB chunks via TF-IDF, invokes Claude Haiku for per-story estimate review, blends CPA output with formula estimates using confidence-weighted interpolation, and gates on risk thresholds before any implementation agent executes.

## Acceptance Criteria
- All stories in scope have a cpa-review.jsonl entry for this run
- No stories in block gate state
- Blended estimates written to prd.json
- citationCoverage >= 0.30 for at least 80% of stories

